    <node id="Paper_2311">
      <data key="d0">Paper</data>
      <data key="d1">InfoVis</data>
      <data key="d2">2019</data>
      <data key="d3">ShapeWordle: Tailoring Wordles using Shape-aware Archimedean Spirals</data>
      <data key="d4">10.1109/tvcg.2019.2934783</data>
      <data key="d5">http://dx.doi.org/10.1109/TVCG.2019.2934783</data>
      <data key="d6">991.0</data>
      <data key="d7">1000.0</data>
      <data key="d8">J</data>
      <data key="d9">We present a new technique to enable the creation of shape-bounded Wordles, we call ShapeWordle, in which we fit words to form a given shape. To guide word placement within a shape, we extend the traditional Archimedean spirals to be shape-aware by formulating the spirals in a differential form using the distance field of the shape. To handle non-convex shapes, we introduce a multi-centric Wordle layout method that segments the shape into parts for our shape-aware spirals to adaptively fill the space and generate word placements. In addition, we offer a set of editing interactions to facilitate the creation of semantically-meaningful Wordles. Lastly, we present three evaluations: a comprehensive comparison of our results against the state-of-the-art technique (WordArt), case studies with 14 users, and a gallery to showcase the coverage of our technique.</data>
      <data key="d10">Yunhai Wang;Xiaowei Chu;Kaiyi Zhang 0003;Chen Bao;Xiaotong Li;Jian Zhang 0070;Chi-Wing Fu;Christophe Hurter;Bongshin Lee;Oliver Deussen</data>
      <data key="d11">Yunhai Wang;Xiaowei Chu;Kaiyi Zhang;Chen Bao;Xiaotong Li;Jian Zhang;Chi-Wing Fu;Christophe Hurter;Oliver Deussen;Bongshin Lee</data>
      <data key="d12">Shandong University;Shandong University;Shandong University;Shandong University;Shandong University;CNIC, CAS;Chinese University of Hong Kong;ENAC, France;Konstanz University, Germany and Shenzhen VisuCA Key Lab, SIAT, China;Microsoft Research</data>
      <data key="d13">10.1109/vast.2007.4389007;10.1109/vast.2009.5333443;10.1109/tvcg.2011.233;10.1109/tvcg.2017.2746018;10.1109/tvcg.2011.223;10.1109/tvcg.2010.175;10.1109/tvcg.2010.194;10.1109/infvis.2004.56;10.1109/tvcg.2009.171;10.1109/tvcg.2017.2745859;10.1109/infvis.2001.963273;10.1109/vast.2007.4389007</data>
      <data key="d14">Wordle,Archimedean spiral,shape</data>
      <data key="d15">8.0</data>
      <data key="d16">10.0</data>
      <data key="d17">42.0</data>
      <data key="d18">815.0</data>
      <data key="d19" />
